    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get ready for the ultimate face off! Play co-op or solo as Max and Finley, two teens from a small hockey town as they take on a frozen wasteland. It's getting colder every day and frost zombies are everywhere. Your only hope? Keep the town's furnaces running and defend them against the frosty hordes! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sweet Hockey Skills - </strong> Slapshots, slashing and body checks - use your hockey skills to take down frost zombies with style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>DIY Traps - </strong> Channel a slap-it-together approach to build and upgrade a variety of makeshift traps like puck launchers or barricades.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Strategic Defense - </strong> Plan your defense like a power play and protect the furnaces from waves of frost zombies.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Survive and Resource Gather- </strong> It's colder than a rink in January out there and only getting colder. Stay toasty and keep that grumbling belly in check while you gather resources for yourself and your traps. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Story - </strong>From underdog to hero! Follow the antics of Max and Finley as they try to find their place in this new world and uncover the mystery of the frost. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic Environment - </strong>Weather changes faster than a ref's bad call. As it gets colder, the challenge ramps up!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Character Customization - </strong>Deck out your characters in different gear.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Game Difficulty - </strong>From Rookie to Veteran, play at different difficulties.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Replayability -</strong> Every furnace features a scoring system, giving you plenty of chances for new plays and epic comebacks! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1572260/extras/d7341df5baf00bb7f111339e1aba586d.avif?t=1727199670\" /></div></p>",
